<title>USA: ASA Holdings Inc Q1 net flat.</title>
<headline>ASA Holdings Inc Q1 net flat.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Highlights	     1997	     1996  % Change</p>
<p> Total revenues		 $89,615,000   $ 89,405,000    .2%</p>
<p> Operating expenses	    73,865,000     72,342,000   2.1%</p>
<p> Operating income	     15,750,000     17,063,000  (7.7%)</p>
<p>Non-operating expense (income)</p>
<p>					1,278,000	1,158,000  10.4%</p>
<p> Income before taxes	  17,028,000     18,221,000  (6.6%)</p>
<p> Provision for taxes	   6,296,000	6,924,000  (9.1%)</p>
<p> Net income		     10,732,000     11,297,000  (5.0%)</p>
<p> Net income per share		  0.36	     0.36</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding 30,031,000     31,490,000  (4.6%)</p>
<p>Operating Highlights</p>
<p> Passengers			   836,455	  836,902</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles (000)  203,799	  201,400   1.2%</p>
<p> Available seat miles (000)     433,175	  431,716    .3%</p>
<p> Load factor			    47.0%	    46.7%  .3pts</p>
<p> Yield/RPM				 43.0	     43.3  (.7%)</p>
<p>NOTE: ASA Holdings is the corporate parent of Atlantic Southeast Airlines Inc.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
